<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, You’re indescribable,</l><l>And, Lord, You’re so enjoyable!</l><l>Lord, You are majestic!</l><l>Lord, You’re so fantastic!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, You are the loveliest,</l><l>And, dear Lord, the finest.</l><l>Lord, You are the highest,</l><l>And, dear One, the very best!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, You’re the most excellent,</l><l>And, Lord, You’re just magnificent!</l><l>Lord, Oh Lord, You’re ultimate!</l><l>Dearest One, You’re infinite!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>No one, Lord, can e’er compete,</l><l>And, dearest Lord, You’re so complete!</l><l>Lord, You’re so refreshing!</l><l>And, Lord, You are my everything!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
